WEBVTT

NOTE Narration is displayed in the caption strip below the video by default.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.770
Test the resource with a new fictional inquiry.

00:00:03.770 --> 00:00:12.724
Ask the participant to select permitted inputs, remove an unsupported approval and name the service reviewer and policy contact.

00:00:12.724 --> 00:00:16.965
Record what actually happened and what still needs correction.

00:00:16.965 --> 00:00:19.793
A self-test is your own check.

00:00:19.793 --> 00:00:22.620
A simulated participant response is simulation.

00:00:22.620 --> 00:00:24.977
Neither proves actual staff readiness.

00:00:24.977 --> 00:00:29.689
Check the written alternative against the same action and criterion.

00:00:29.689 --> 00:00:36.287
Revise unclear wording or missing support, then update only readiness judgments supported by evidence.

00:00:36.287 --> 00:00:40.999
Explain how the policy demonstration addresses the evidenced input-selection barrier.

00:00:40.999 --> 00:00:49.482
Save the resource, actions, alternative, test result and limits in the existing adoption-plan section of your Project Record.

00:00:49.482 --> 00:00:56.551
The associated Journey Three workbook section supports study; do not create a separate training workbook.

00:00:56.551 --> 00:00:58.436
Pending permission remains pending.
